OL,3,ARussia-bound ship towed away after it
OL,4,Awas attacked in Gulf of Finland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Russian cargo vessel that was hit by
OL,7,Fa drone attack in the eastern Gulf of
OL,8,FFinland is being towed away,
OL,9,Fauthorities have said.
OL,11,FThe Sparta II had been bound for
OL,12,FRussia's Baltic exclave Kaliningrad
OL,13,Fwhen it was hit on Saturday morning,
OL,14,Fsparking a fire aboard.
OL,16,FIt then drifted into Finnish waters and
OL,17,Fits crew were evacuated to Russia.
OL,18,FFinnish defence forces said Ukraine was
OL,19,Flikely behind the attack. Kyiv has yet
OL,20,Fto comment.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
